{"unit_id":"x2802490130-prog__dsh-balance-float#feature-1","repo":"x2802490130-prog/dsh-balance-float","commit":"14311f51e81b5b1fef335705d4e56c788d091979","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-float 的功能「余额悬浮窗」：在 DSH 网页角落显示 DeepSeek 余额，并展开总额、赠送额、充值额及更新时间。页面加载后自动查询，随后每分钟刷新；点击刷新按钮可立即重新请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:64-72","client/client.js:87-105","client/client.js:190-192"]}
